{"3757140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Of Peaks and Tides", "steam_appid": 3757140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient spark has not yet faded. Whispers echo through the mountains and seas, stirring memories long buried in the earth.<i>Of Peaks and Tides</i> is an Open-world Crafting Survival game developed by CyancookGames, weaving Eastern Mythology into a vast, living world.Powered by an intuitive physics system, the world responds to your every touch. Gather your friends, and shape your own legend in a land where creation knows no bounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/8c779e8dcdbc8d37d980c3fa3aa08b77.poster.avif?t=1785841855\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/8c779e8dcdbc8d37d980c3fa3aa08b77.webm?t=1785841855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/c8ee55098a933c3751e6bac96a9f59e0.webp?t=1785841855\" width=411 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/a5660eaab466fe8ff594f259cd8c1a5e.poster.avif?t=1785841855\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/a5660eaab466fe8ff594f259cd8c1a5e.webm?t=1785841855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything reacts. Everything can be a resource. Emergent gameplay lets your choices spark unexpected consequences. From chaos come opportunities. Shifting seasons, unpredictable weather, and calamities demand smart, responsive choices. Build wisely, read the skies, and turn disasters into power. The world lives, and you will shape it by your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/c651e5e63cc434b9382f1da78df4a1e4.webp?t=1785841855\" width=414 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/b1eab3c9a86fe5d9a49c6f2337cf3141.poster.avif?t=1785841855\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/b1eab3c9a86fe5d9a49c6f2337cf3141.webm?t=1785841855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faced with a powerful enemy, will you charge head-on with sheer skills? Or leverage the environment to strike unexpectedly?Will you set fire, flood the battlefield, lay traps, or stir their hatred to turn enemies against each other in chaos?There is no &quot;correct answer&quot; — only your unique path to victory.Break the rules! Define your legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/0990e19491da08c74a742aef531f4fd4.webp?t=1785841855\" width=414 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/cac0e935daa57b5f79771d38895ce64c.poster.avif?t=1785841855\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/cac0e935daa57b5f79771d38895ce64c.webm?t=1785841855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One journey, countless paths. Your choices shape the world.From surviving the wilds to reviving civilization, from brittle twigs and scattered stones to roaring engines of war—this long-silent land shall once again witness the epic rise of humankind, forged by your hands.With a stone axe in hand, you will fell trees for palisades, stack stones into walls, and raise an unyielding stronghold beneath the shadow of calamity and colossal beasts.What you build is more than shelter from the storm, more than weapons to turn the tide of battle—it is the courage to stand against the old deities, and the hope to reclaim the legacy of the ancients, to restore your people to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/f1074cf1f18fa4c0c763ccf7480e1533.webp?t=1785841855\" width=411 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/d5f028452e3a55a984f81fc0b594d9df.poster.avif?t=1785841855\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/d5f028452e3a55a984f81fc0b594d9df.webm?t=1785841855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic survival — luck won’t save you. Tame wild creatures, build bonds, and turn them into your most loyal partners. Clear land, adapt to the world, and raise life from the forest, soil, and everything in between. Build a home to anchor your survival. Every plant and creature has its own growth patterns and needs. Only by understanding them — and working alongside your beasts — can you truly thrive on this untamed land.Nature won't help you. Bend it to your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/96fe4c5cfe202c2675e8ecbd042cf8a8.webp?t=1785841855\" width=414 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/fdf604534330e026f5f899d5012ea5e8.poster.avif?t=1785841855\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/fdf604534330e026f5f899d5012ea5e8.webm?t=1785841855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As Nolands, you awaken in the depths of Lushland. Once, under the blessing of the deities, your forebears forged a once-resplendent civilization—an era of wondrous crafts and countless creations. But all was torn asunder in the great War between Heaven and Man, when mountains crumbled and seas were split apart.Now, divine relics lie in ruins, and the glory of the old world has turned to ash. Only the shattered Ascent remains, silently watching over the fading embers of what once was.Wind, thunder, water, and flame—forces once wielded by the deities—have become calamities, scouring the land. Unique beasts now roam unchecked, and natural order has descended into chaos.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient spark has not yet faded. Whispers echo through the mountains and seas, stirring memories long buried in the earth.<i>Of Peaks and Tides</i> is an Open-world Crafting Survival game developed by CyancookGames, weaving Eastern Mythology into a vast, living world.Powered by an intuitive physics system, the world responds to your every touch. Gather your friends, and shape your own legend in a land where creation knows no bounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/8c779e8dcdbc8d37d980c3fa3aa08b77.poster.avif?t=1785841855\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/8c779e8dcdbc8d37d980c3fa3aa08b77.webm?t=1785841855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/c8ee55098a933c3751e6bac96a9f59e0.webp?t=1785841855\" width=411 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/a5660eaab466fe8ff594f259cd8c1a5e.poster.avif?t=1785841855\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/a5660eaab466fe8ff594f259cd8c1a5e.webm?t=1785841855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything reacts. Everything can be a resource. Emergent gameplay lets your choices spark unexpected consequences. From chaos come opportunities. Shifting seasons, unpredictable weather, and calamities demand smart, responsive choices. Build wisely, read the skies, and turn disasters into power. The world lives, and you will shape it by your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/c651e5e63cc434b9382f1da78df4a1e4.webp?t=1785841855\" width=414 height=57 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/b1eab3c9a86fe5d9a49c6f2337cf3141.poster.avif?t=1785841855\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/b1eab3c9a86fe5d9a49c6f2337cf3141.webm?t=1785841855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faced with a powerful enemy, will you charge head-on with sheer skills? Or leverage the environment to strike unexpectedly?Will you set fire, flood the battlefield, lay traps, or stir their hatred to turn enemies against each other in chaos?There is no &quot;correct answer&quot; — only your unique path to victory.Break the rules! Define your legend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/0990e19491da08c74a742aef531f4fd4.webp?t=1785841855\" width=414 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/cac0e935daa57b5f79771d38895ce64c.poster.avif?t=1785841855\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/cac0e935daa57b5f79771d38895ce64c.webm?t=1785841855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One journey, countless paths. Your choices shape the world.From surviving the wilds to reviving civilization, from brittle twigs and scattered stones to roaring engines of war—this long-silent land shall once again witness the epic rise of humankind, forged by your hands.With a stone axe in hand, you will fell trees for palisades, stack stones into walls, and raise an unyielding stronghold beneath the shadow of calamity and colossal beasts.What you build is more than shelter from the storm, more than weapons to turn the tide of battle—it is the courage to stand against the old deities, and the hope to reclaim the legacy of the ancients, to restore your people to glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/f1074cf1f18fa4c0c763ccf7480e1533.webp?t=1785841855\" width=411 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/d5f028452e3a55a984f81fc0b594d9df.poster.avif?t=1785841855\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/d5f028452e3a55a984f81fc0b594d9df.webm?t=1785841855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic survival — luck won’t save you. Tame wild creatures, build bonds, and turn them into your most loyal partners. Clear land, adapt to the world, and raise life from the forest, soil, and everything in between. Build a home to anchor your survival. Every plant and creature has its own growth patterns and needs. Only by understanding them — and working alongside your beasts — can you truly thrive on this untamed land.Nature won't help you. Bend it to your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/96fe4c5cfe202c2675e8ecbd042cf8a8.webp?t=1785841855\" width=414 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/fdf604534330e026f5f899d5012ea5e8.poster.avif?t=1785841855\" width=616 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/extras/fdf604534330e026f5f899d5012ea5e8.webm?t=1785841855\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As Nolands, you awaken in the depths of Lushland. Once, under the blessing of the deities, your forebears forged a once-resplendent civilization—an era of wondrous crafts and countless creations. But all was torn asunder in the great War between Heaven and Man, when mountains crumbled and seas were split apart.Now, divine relics lie in ruins, and the glory of the old world has turned to ash. Only the shattered Ascent remains, silently watching over the fading embers of what once was.Wind, thunder, water, and flame—forces once wielded by the deities—have become calamities, scouring the land. Unique beasts now roam unchecked, and natural order has descended into chaos.</p>", "short_description": "Step onto this vast ancient land shaped by intuitive physics, and form a new world born of your imagination. Explore solo or team up online with friends. Reforge the mortal realm devastated by divine wrath. Feel the world shift with your every move. Your lands await. Will you answer?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/15f596dd123896e7a39760cebee7660785e9b1dd/header.jpg?t=1785841855", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/12eef73dd25073558f6f2a1fc80601037d3b24ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785841855", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3757140/12eef73dd25073558f6f2a1fc80601037d3b24ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785841855", "website": "https://www.cyancook.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows®10 (64-bit Required)/Windows®11 (64-bit Required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-10400 或 AMD Ryzen™ 5 3600 or above (For Cl